          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.skosProperties.skosConcept.Concept.prefLabel.comment" xmi:uuid="e0064bf2-a091-504b-a44c-1b110948837c">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

